00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,540
reading task for building a McDonald's I was excited when I heard that our

2
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:14,260
community was to have its own McDonald's restaurant I thought about all those

3
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:18,840
young people who would not have to go to the next town to buy their favorite

4
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:24,400
burgers and chips McDonald's cares about healthy eating too and works with

5
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,560
It is also cheap.

6
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:35,820
They often provide salads as well as burgers and chips.

7
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:45,800
Of course it also means more work for our area that needs jobs badly.

8
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:59,960
So I think they will be concerned about providing parking for the cars in our main street.

9
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:04,600
Many of our young people will be only too happy to work for the company.

10
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:09,060
McDonald’s makes a promise to the people who work for them.

11
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:15,000
They say, "We value you, your growing skills and your help to the company."

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,860
I can see nothing

13
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:21,840
but good if this company comes to build its restaurant in our town.

14
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:36,280
We are a small community and we enjoy our local dishes.

15
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:42,080
I am not sure if McDonald’s food is as healthy as they say in their advertisements.

16
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:50,040
This is very worrying.

17
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:54,680
Too many young people are getting fat through eating too much fatty food.

18
00:01:54,680 --> 00:02:00,540
McDonald’s is not giving young people a good idea of what a healthy diet should be.

19
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,760
Local Chinese food, on the other hand,

20
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:06,600
is full of fresh vegetables and fresh meat and fish.

21
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:16,160
Although it is freshly cooked,

22
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:19,200
it must be less healthy than our own locally grown

23
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,740
and cooked Chinese food.

24
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:26,960
I also worry about all those cars bringing people to buy food at McDonald’s.

25
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:29,560
First, there will be petrol fumes(气体),

26
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,800
which will make our clean air dirty.

27
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:36,300
Second, there is the problem of all those cars that try to park

28
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:39,580
and prevent other cars from moving quickly through our town.

29
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:44,940
I am sure many young people will be happy to work for McDonald’s

30
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:46,640
but will they be treated fairly?

31
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:52,040
In America, McDonald’s does not allow workers’ unions to operate in its restaurants

32
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:54,620
and these are people who speak up for the workers.

33
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:58,220
If, as they say, the workers are happy with them,

34
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,920
why should they fear some workers joining a union?

35
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:05,280
So when I consider the food, the cars and the jobs,

36
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:10,040
I think we should not allow McDonald’s to build their restaurant in our town.
